<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor rises in December. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>KLM load factor rises in December. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>AMSTERDAM, Jan 8, Reuter - Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines (millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			 Dec '96   Dec '95  Apr-Dec 96  Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic		715.2     677.1     6,542.1     6,132.2</p>
<p>Capacity	   1,006.5     969.4     8,996.0     8,412.5</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)   71.1	69.9	  72.7	  72.9</p>
<p>(Corrects Dec '95 capacity figure from 696.4 to 969.4)</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Passenger km    4,076.3    3,602.5    37,908.0    34,551.9</p>
<p>Seat km	   5,700.1    5,215.7    50,080.5    46,158.2</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)  71.5	 69.1	  75.7	  74.9</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic	     332.8	338.1     2,970.2     2,876.2</p>
<p>Capacity	    506.5	516.1     4,490.2     4,280.2</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)  65.7	 65.5	  66.1	  67.2</p>
<p>-- Amerstam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
